@lang en
IMPORT `pvi-health-assessment`

-- Tests of PART III (PHẦN III. QUYỀN LỢI BẢO HIỂM) and of the assessment that puts the layers
-- together. Expected values are the source's waiting periods (0, 30, 60, 180, 365, 730 days), ages
-- (15 days, 6, 10, 18, 45), percentages (30/70, 10%, 100%), counts (60 days a year, scaling once
-- a year, 24 hours) and caps, applied by hand to hypothetical amounts. Calendar facts (computed
-- once with a script and written here): from 1 January 2026, day 29 is 30 January, day 30 is
-- 31 January, day 59 is 1 March, day 60 is 2 March, day 179 is 29 June, day 180 is 30 June, day
-- 364 is 31 December 2026, day 365 is 1 January 2027, day 729 is 31 December 2027, day 730 is
-- 1 January 2028.

§ `Tests — Part III and the assessment`

§§ `Helpers for these tests`

GIVEN benefit IS A `A benefit`
      cause IS A `A cause`
      who IS AN `An insured person`
      cert IS A `A certificate`
      arose IS A DATE
      fac IS A `A medical facility`
      tr IS A `The treatment`
      conds IS A LIST OF `A condition`
      cost IS A `The costs claimed`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a claim for` benefit `, cause` cause `, by` who `, under` cert `, on` arose `, at` fac `, treated` tr `, for` conds `, costs` cost MEANS
    `a plain claim under` cert `by` who `for` benefit `, cause` cause `, arising and treated` arose `at` fac `:` tr `; conditions` conds `; circumstances` EMPTY `; costs` cost

GIVEN c IS A `A claim`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the waiting period is over for` c MEANS
    `the event in` c `arose after a waiting period of` (`the waiting period in days for` c)

GIVEN `the other medical costs` IS A NUMBER
      `paid by another insurer` IS A NUMBER
      `paid this year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `The costs claimed`
`costs of` `the other medical costs` `, another insurer paid` `paid by another insurer` `, paid this year` `paid this year` MEANS
    `costs: surgery` 0 `, other medical` `the other medical costs` `, paid by another insurer` `paid by another insurer` `, vitamins` 0 `, drugs` 0 `, hospital days already paid` 0 `, paid this year` `paid this year`

GIVEN who IS AN `An insured person`
      cert IS A `A certificate`
      arose IS A DATE
      ev IS A `A maternity event`
      fac IS A `A medical facility`
      cost IS A `The costs claimed`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a maternity claim by` who `, under` cert `, on` arose `, for` ev `, at` fac `, costs` cost MEANS
    `a claim by` who `under` cert `for` `maternity` `, claimant` `the insured person` `, cause` `pregnancy or childbirth` `, arising` arose `, treated` arose `at` fac `:` `a three-night stay` `; conditions` EMPTY `; circumstances` EMPTY `; history` `no earlier history` `; costs` cost `; dental items` EMPTY `; maternity` (JUST ev) `; death or injury` `nothing permanent` `; driving` FALSE `; authorised` FALSE

GIVEN benefit IS A `A benefit`
      cause IS A `A cause`
      cert IS A `A certificate`
      arose IS A DATE
      facts IS A `The facts of death or permanent injury`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a death or injury claim for` benefit `, cause` cause `, under` cert `, on` arose `, with` facts MEANS
    `a claim by` `the adult woman` `under` cert `for` benefit `, claimant` `a lawful beneficiary` `, cause` cause `, arising` arose `, treated` arose `at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `:` `an outpatient visit` `; conditions` EMPTY `; circumstances` EMPTY `; history` `no earlier history` `; costs` `no other costs` `; dental items` EMPTY `; maternity` NOTHING `; death or injury` facts `; driving` FALSE `; authorised` FALSE

GIVEN cert IS A `A certificate`
      arose IS A DATE
      fac IS A `A medical facility`
      items IS A LIST OF `A dental item`
      scalings IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a dental claim under` cert `, on` arose `, at` fac `, for` items `, scalings already paid` scalings MEANS
    `a claim by` `the adult woman` `under` cert `for` `dental care` `, claimant` `the insured person` `, cause` `an illness` `, arising` arose `, treated` arose `at` fac `:` `a dental visit` `; conditions` EMPTY `; circumstances` EMPTY `; history` `no earlier history` `; costs` (`The costs claimed` WITH `costs of the surgery` IS 0, `other medical costs` IS 0, `paid under another insurance contract` IS 0, `cost of the vitamins or minerals` IS 0, `cost of the treatment drugs` IS 0, `days of hospitalisation already paid in this insurance year` IS 0, `already paid in this insurance year` IS 0, `scalings already paid in this insurance year` IS scalings) `; dental items` items `; maternity` NOTHING `; death or injury` `nothing permanent` `; driving` FALSE `; authorised` FALSE

GIVEN s IS A `A dental service`
      n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A dental item`
s `costing` n MEANS `A dental item` WITH `service` IS s, `cost` IS n

§§ `Waiting periods — A.2 and B.1`

`an illness on 30 January 2026, first year` MEANS `a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 1 30) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a three-night stay` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` `no other costs`
`an illness on 31 January 2026, first year` MEANS `a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 1 31) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a three-night stay` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` `no other costs`
#ASSERT `the waiting period in days for` `an illness on 31 January 2026, first year` EQUALS 30
#ASSERT NOT (`the waiting period is over for` `an illness on 30 January 2026, first year`)
#ASSERT     `the waiting period is over for` `an illness on 31 January 2026, first year`
-- an accident: in force at once
#ASSERT `the waiting period in days for` (`a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an accident` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 1 1) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a three-night stay` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` `no other costs`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the waiting period is over for` (`a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an accident` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 1 1) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a three-night stay` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` `no other costs`)
-- a child aged 5 with bronchitis: 180 days; a child aged 7 with pneumonia: 30.
#ASSERT `the waiting period in days for` (`a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the child of five` `, under` `the child's first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 29) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a three-night stay` `, for` (LIST `bronchitis`) `, costs` `no other costs`) EQUALS 180
#ASSERT NOT (`the waiting period is over for` (`a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the child of five` `, under` `the child's first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 29) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a three-night stay` `, for` (LIST `bronchitis`) `, costs` `no other costs`))
#ASSERT     `the waiting period is over for` (`a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the child of five` `, under` `the child's first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 30) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a three-night stay` `, for` (LIST `bronchitis`) `, costs` `no other costs`)
#ASSERT `the waiting period in days for` (`a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the child of seven` `, under` `the child's first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 29) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a three-night stay` `, for` (LIST `pneumonia`) `, costs` `no other costs`) EQUALS 30
-- a chronic disease: 365 days.
#ASSERT `the waiting period in days for` (`a claim for` `outpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 12 31) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a three-night stay for a chronic disease` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` `no other costs`) EQUALS 365
#ASSERT NOT (`the waiting period is over for` (`a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 12 31) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a three-night stay for a chronic disease` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` `no other costs`))
#ASSERT     `the waiting period is over for` (`a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2027 1 1) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a three-night stay for a chronic disease` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` `no other costs`)
-- a special disease: 365 days.
#ASSERT `the waiting period in days for` (`a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a three-night stay` `, for` (LIST `hypertension`) `, costs` `no other costs`) EQUALS 365

§§ `Waiting periods — continuous renewal`

GIVEN cert IS A `A certificate`
      benefit IS A `A benefit`
      tr IS A `The treatment`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a chronic disease on 1 June 2026 under` cert `, claimed under` benefit `, treated` tr MEANS
    `a claim for` benefit `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` cert `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` tr `, for` (LIST `hypertension`) `, costs` `no other costs`

-- Renewed without a break since 2024: the waiting periods run from 1 January 2024.
#ASSERT `the date the waiting periods run from, for` (`a chronic disease on 1 June 2026 under` `the renewed certificate` `, claimed under` `inpatient treatment` `, treated` `a three-night stay`) EQUALS YMD 2024 1 1
#ASSERT `the waiting period is over for` (`a chronic disease on 1 June 2026 under` `the renewed certificate` `, claimed under` `inpatient treatment` `, treated` `a three-night stay`)
-- The 2026 certificate raised the benefits: not a continuous renewal, so they run from 2026.
#ASSERT `the date the waiting periods run from, for` (`a chronic disease on 1 June 2026 under` `the upgraded certificate` `, claimed under` `inpatient treatment` `, treated` `a three-night stay`) EQUALS YMD 2026 1 1
#ASSERT NOT (`the waiting period is over for` (`a chronic disease on 1 June 2026 under` `the upgraded certificate` `, claimed under` `inpatient treatment` `, treated` `a three-night stay`))
-- 2025 carried no supplementary benefit: B.1 runs from 2026, the main benefit A.2 from 2024.
#ASSERT `the date the waiting periods run from, for` (`a chronic disease on 1 June 2026 under` `the certificate renewed without riders in 2025` `, claimed under` `outpatient treatment` `, treated` `an outpatient visit`) EQUALS YMD 2026 1 1
#ASSERT `the date the waiting periods run from, for` (`a chronic disease on 1 June 2026 under` `the certificate renewed without riders in 2025` `, claimed under` `inpatient treatment` `, treated` `a three-night stay`) EQUALS YMD 2024 1 1
-- The 2026 premium was not paid in full and on time: the chain breaks at 2026.
#ASSERT `the date the waiting periods run from, for` (`a chronic disease on 1 June 2026 under` `the renewed certificate, premium unpaid` `, claimed under` `inpatient treatment` `, treated` `a three-night stay`) EQUALS YMD 2026 1 1
-- A certificate that does not show the waiting periods carries none (fork F19).
#ASSERT `the waiting period is over for` (`a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the first-year certificate not showing waiting periods` `, on` (YMD 2026 1 2) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a three-night stay for a chronic disease` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` `no other costs`)

§§ `Waiting periods — B.2, B.3, B.4`

-- Dental: 30 days, an accident included.
#ASSERT `the waiting period in days for` (`a claim for` `dental care` `, cause` `an accident` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 1 30) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a dental visit` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` `no other costs`) EQUALS 30
#ASSERT NOT (`the waiting period is over for` (`a claim for` `dental care` `, cause` `an accident` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 1 30) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a dental visit` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` `no other costs`))
-- Maternity: 60 days for a complication, 365 for childbirth, a caesarean section included.
#ASSERT NOT (`the waiting period is over for` (`a maternity claim by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 3 1) `, for` (`a complication` `ectopic pregnancy`) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, costs` `no other costs`))
#ASSERT     `the waiting period is over for` (`a maternity claim by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 3 2) `, for` (`a complication` `ectopic pregnancy`) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, costs` `no other costs`)
#ASSERT `the waiting period in days for` (`a maternity claim by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 3 2) `, for` `a normal delivery` `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, costs` `no other costs`) EQUALS 365
#ASSERT `the waiting period in days for` (`a maternity claim by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 3 2) `, for` (`a caesarean section` TRUE) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, costs` `no other costs`) EQUALS 365
#ASSERT REFUSED `the waiting period in days for` (`a plain claim under` `the first-year certificate` `by` `the adult woman` `for` `maternity` `, cause` `pregnancy or childbirth` `, arising and treated` (YMD 2026 6 1) `at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `:` `a three-night stay` `; conditions` EMPTY `; circumstances` EMPTY `; costs` `no other costs`) BECAUSE "a maternity claim that names no maternity event cannot be assessed"
-- Death from illness: 30 days, or 730 for a chronic, special or pre-existing disease.
#ASSERT `the waiting period in days for` (`a death or injury claim for` `death from illness` `, cause` `an illness` `, under` `the first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, with` (`an outcome:` (`death of the insured person` (YMD 2026 6 1)) `, treatment ended` FALSE `, already paid under Benefit 2` 0)) EQUALS 30
#ASSERT `the waiting period in days for` (`a chronic disease on 1 June 2026 under` `the first-year certificate` `, claimed under` `death from illness` `, treated` `a three-night stay`) EQUALS 730

§§ `Scope — A.1 personal accident`

`a death by accident on 1 June 2026` MEANS `an outcome:` (`death of the insured person` (YMD 2026 6 10)) `, treatment ended` FALSE `, already paid under Benefit 2` 0
#ASSERT null (`what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`a death or injury claim for` `personal accident` `, cause` `an accident` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, with` `a death by accident on 1 June 2026`))
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`a death or injury claim for` `personal accident` `, cause` `an accident` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, with` `nothing permanent`) EQUALS LIST (`outside the scope of the benefit` "A.1.1: death, or a permanent injury as Part II defines it")
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`a death or injury claim for` `personal accident` `, cause` `an illness` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, with` `a death by accident on 1 June 2026`) EQUALS LIST (`outside the scope of the benefit` "A.1.1: an accident as Part II defines it")

§§ `Scope — A.2 inpatient`

GIVEN tr IS A `The treatment`
      cause IS A `A cause`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`an inpatient claim, renewed, treated` tr `, cause` cause MEANS
    `a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` cause `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` tr `, for` EMPTY `, costs` `no other costs`

#ASSERT null (`what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`an inpatient claim, renewed, treated` `a three-night stay` `, cause` `an illness`))
#ASSERT null (`what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`an inpatient claim, renewed, treated` `a three-night stay with surgery` `, cause` `an accident`))
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`an inpatient claim, renewed, treated` `a day treatment` `, cause` `an illness`) EQUALS LIST (`outside the scope of the benefit` "A.2.3: a hospitalisation that is not day treatment, or a surgery that is not day surgery")
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`an inpatient claim, renewed, treated` `a day surgery` `, cause` `an illness`) EQUALS LIST (`outside the scope of the benefit` "A.2.3: a hospitalisation that is not day treatment, or a surgery that is not day surgery")
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`an inpatient claim, renewed, treated` `a dental stay` `, cause` `an illness`) EQUALS LIST (`outside the scope of the benefit` "A.2: dental treatment is not included")
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`an inpatient claim, renewed, treated` `a three-night stay` `, cause` `pregnancy or childbirth`) EQUALS LIST (`outside the scope of the benefit` "A.2.1: an illness or an accident")

§§ `Scope — B.1 outpatient`

GIVEN tr IS A `The treatment`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`an outpatient claim, renewed, treated` tr MEANS
    `a claim for` `outpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` tr `, for` EMPTY `, costs` `no other costs`

#ASSERT null (`what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`an outpatient claim, renewed, treated` `an outpatient visit`))
#ASSERT null (`what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`an outpatient claim, renewed, treated` `a day treatment`))
#ASSERT null (`what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`an outpatient claim, renewed, treated` `a day surgery`))
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`an outpatient claim, renewed, treated` `a three-night stay`) EQUALS LIST (`outside the scope of the benefit` "B.1.1: outpatient treatment, day treatment or day surgery")
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`an outpatient claim, renewed, treated` `an outpatient visit with no diagnosis`) EQUALS LIST (`excluded by the benefit's own exclusions` "B.1.3, first limb: examination and tests without a doctor's conclusion of a disease")
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`an outpatient claim, renewed, treated` `an outpatient visit with a diagnosis and no protocol`) EQUALS LIST (`excluded by the benefit's own exclusions` "B.1.3, third limb: a doctor's conclusion but no specific treatment protocol")

§§ `Scope — B.2 dental`

`a filling for 500,000` MEANS LIST (`a filling with an ordinary material` `costing` 500_000)
#ASSERT null (`what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`a dental claim under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, for` `a filling for 500,000` `, scalings already paid` 0))
#ASSERT null (`what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`a dental claim under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a clinic in Da Nang` `, for` `a filling for 500,000` `, scalings already paid` 0))
-- a private clinic in Hanoi with no PVI agreement is outside dental cover (finding X16)
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`a dental claim under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a private clinic in Hanoi` `, for` `a filling for 500,000` `, scalings already paid` 0) EQUALS LIST (`outside the scope of the benefit` "B.2.1: a facility where dental care is covered")
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`a dental claim under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a clinic in Da Nang on PVI's refused list` `, for` `a filling for 500,000` `, scalings already paid` 0) EQUALS LIST (`outside the scope of the benefit` "B.2.1: a facility where dental care is covered")
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`a dental claim under` (`the renewed certificate with outpatient:` FALSE `, dental:` TRUE `, maternity:` TRUE) `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, for` `a filling for 500,000` `, scalings already paid` 0) EQUALS LIST (`outside the scope of the benefit` "B.2: taken only with supplementary benefit 1")

§§ `Scope — B.3 maternity`

#ASSERT null (`what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`a maternity claim by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, for` `a normal delivery` `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, costs` `no other costs`))
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`a maternity claim by` `the adult man` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, for` `a normal delivery` `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, costs` `no other costs`) EQUALS LIST `the insured person was not eligible for the benefit`
-- 45 on the start date is within; 46 is not.
#ASSERT null (`what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`a maternity claim by` (`a healthy citizen born on` (YMD 1980 6 1) `, a woman:` TRUE `, continuously insured since 60:` FALSE) `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, for` `a normal delivery` `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, costs` `no other costs`))
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`a maternity claim by` (`a healthy citizen born on` (YMD 1979 6 1) `, a woman:` TRUE `, continuously insured since 60:` FALSE) `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, for` `a normal delivery` `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, costs` `no other costs`) EQUALS LIST `the insured person was not eligible for the benefit`
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`a maternity claim by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the renewed certificate on programme 3` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, for` `a normal delivery` `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, costs` `no other costs`) EQUALS LIST `the insured person was not eligible for the benefit`
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`a maternity claim by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, for` (`a caesarean section` FALSE) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, costs` `no other costs`) EQUALS LIST (`outside the scope of the benefit` "B.3.1: a complication, a necessary caesarean section, or a normal delivery")
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`a maternity claim by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, for` `a normal delivery` `, at` `a hospital in Singapore` `, costs` `no other costs`) EQUALS LIST (`outside the scope of the benefit` "B.3.1: a state or private facility licensed in Vietnam")

§§ `Scope — B.4 death from illness`

#ASSERT null (`what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`a death or injury claim for` `death from illness` `, cause` `an illness` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, with` `a death by accident on 1 June 2026`))
#ASSERT `what the claim lacks for the scope of the benefit claimed` (`a death or injury claim for` `death from illness` `, cause` `an accident` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, with` `a death by accident on 1 June 2026`) EQUALS LIST (`outside the scope of the benefit` "B.4.1: death from an illness")

§§ `Amounts — A.1 personal accident (sum insured 100,000,000)`

GIVEN facts IS A `The facts of death or permanent injury`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`A.1 pays, on an accident on 15 June 2026, for` facts MEANS
    `the amount PVI pays on` (`a death or injury claim for` `personal accident` `, cause` `an accident` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `, with` facts)

-- Benefit 1: death, the whole sum insured; total permanent injury at 85%, the whole sum insured.
#ASSERT `A.1 pays, on an accident on 15 June 2026, for` (`an outcome:` (`death of the insured person` (YMD 2026 7 1)) `, treatment ended` FALSE `, already paid under Benefit 2` 0) EQUALS 100_000_000
#ASSERT `A.1 pays, on an accident on 15 June 2026, for` (`an outcome:` (`a permanent injury` (YMD 2026 10 1) (85%) NOTHING) `, treatment ended` TRUE `, already paid under Benefit 2` 0) EQUALS 100_000_000
-- Benefit 2: 30% in the annex, 30% of the sum insured.
#ASSERT `A.1 pays, on an accident on 15 June 2026, for` (`an outcome:` (`a permanent injury` (YMD 2026 10 1) (30%) (JUST (30%))) `, treatment ended` TRUE `, already paid under Benefit 2` 0) EQUALS 30_000_000
-- 1.4: 80,000,000 already paid for the same accident; another 30% is capped at the 20,000,000 left.
#ASSERT `A.1 pays, on an accident on 15 June 2026, for` (`an outcome:` (`a permanent injury` (YMD 2026 10 1) (30%) (JUST (30%))) `, treatment ended` TRUE `, already paid under Benefit 2` 80_000_000) EQUALS 20_000_000
-- not in the annex: nothing under Benefit 2
#ASSERT `A.1 pays, on an accident on 15 June 2026, for` (`an outcome:` (`a permanent injury` (YMD 2026 10 1) (30%) NOTHING) `, treatment ended` TRUE `, already paid under Benefit 2` 0) EQUALS 0
-- 1.4 (iv): 30,000,000 paid under Benefit 2, death within one year of the accident: the
-- difference, 70,000,000; on the anniversary still within; the day after, nothing.
#ASSERT `A.1 pays, on an accident on 15 June 2026, for` (`an outcome:` (`death of the insured person` (YMD 2026 12 1)) `, treatment ended` TRUE `, already paid under Benefit 2` 30_000_000) EQUALS 70_000_000
#ASSERT `A.1 — the amount payable on` (`a death or injury claim for` `personal accident` `, cause` `an accident` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `, with` (`an outcome:` (`death of the insured person` (YMD 2027 6 15)) `, treatment ended` TRUE `, already paid under Benefit 2` 30_000_000)) EQUALS 70_000_000
#ASSERT `A.1 — the amount payable on` (`a death or injury claim for` `personal accident` `, cause` `an accident` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 15) `, with` (`an outcome:` (`death of the insured person` (YMD 2027 6 16)) `, treatment ended` TRUE `, already paid under Benefit 2` 30_000_000)) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `A.1.4 — the interest PVI pays on any amount under the Rules` EQUALS 0

