#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` (`a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a three-night stay` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` (`costs of` 0 `, another insurer paid` 0 `, paid this year` 195_000_000)) EQUALS 5_000_000
-- 60 days in an insurance year: of a 61-day stay at 1,000,000 a day, 60,000,000; with 58 days
