§§ `Amounts — the co-payment for a child under 10`

-- The child's certificate has a hospitalisation limit of 6,000,000. Three nights cost 9,000,000.
-- At a private hospital PVI pays 70% of the lower of 9,000,000 and 6,000,000: 4,200,000. At a
-- public hospital, 100%: 6,000,000. In a public hospital's international department, 4,200,000.
GIVEN fac IS A `A medical facility`
      who IS AN `An insured person`
GIVETH A `A claim`
`a three-night stay for a child at` fac `, the child being` who MEANS
    `a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` who `, under` `the child's renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` fac `, treated` `a three-night stay` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` `no other costs`
#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` (`a three-night stay for a child at` `a private hospital in Ho Chi Minh City` `, the child being` `the child of five`) EQUALS 4_200_000
#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` (`a three-night stay for a child at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, the child being` `the child of five`) EQUALS 6_000_000
#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` (`a three-night stay for a child at` `the international department of a public hospital in Hanoi` `, the child being` `the child of five`) EQUALS 4_200_000
-- Aged 10 on the date of treatment: no co-payment (born 1 May 2016).
#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` (`a three-night stay for a child at` `a private hospital in Ho Chi Minh City` `, the child being` (`a healthy citizen born on` (YMD 2016 5 1) `, a woman:` FALSE `, continuously insured since 60:` FALSE)) EQUALS 6_000_000

§§ `The scenario where the layers interact`

-- A child of five, insured with a parent and renewed without a break since 2024, spends four nights
-- at a private hospital in Ho Chi Minh City for an ordinary illness on 1 June 2026. Another
-- insurer has paid 9,000,000 of the costs. Layer 1: covered (no ground of refusal). Layer 2: the
-- stay costs 4 x 3,000,000 = 12,000,000; the co-payment for a child under 10 at a non-public
-- hospital gives PVI 70% of the lower of 12,000,000 and the 6,000,000 limit, 4,200,000; Part I
-- clause 3 leaves PVI no more than the 3,000,000 the other insurer did not pay; the sum insured
-- left (200,000,000) does not bite. PVI pays 3,000,000. Without the other insurer, 4,200,000.
`the layered scenario` MEANS
    `a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the child of five` `, under` `the child's renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a private hospital in Ho Chi Minh City` `, treated` `a four-night stay` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` (`costs of` 0 `, another insurer paid` 9_000_000 `, paid this year` 0)
`the layered scenario, no other insurer` MEANS
    `a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the child of five` `, under` `the child's renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a private hospital in Ho Chi Minh City` `, treated` `a four-night stay` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` `no other costs`
#ASSERT `the claim is covered` `the layered scenario`
#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` `the layered scenario` EQUALS 3_000_000
#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` `the layered scenario, no other insurer` EQUALS 4_200_000

§§ `Amounts — B.1, B.2, B.3, B.4`

-- Outpatient: 1,500,000 paid in full for an adult; 70% (1,050,000) for a child of five at a private
-- hospital; 12,000,000 capped at the 10,000,000 limit.
#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` (`a claim for` `outpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `an outpatient visit` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` (`costs of` 1_500_000 `, another insurer paid` 0 `, paid this year` 0)) EQUALS 1_500_000
#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` (`a claim for` `outpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the child of five` `, under` `the child's renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a private hospital in Ho Chi Minh City` `, treated` `an outpatient visit` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` (`costs of` 1_500_000 `, another insurer paid` 0 `, paid this year` 0)) EQUALS 1_050_000
#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` (`a claim for` `outpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `an outpatient visit` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` (`costs of` 12_000_000 `, another insurer paid` 0 `, paid this year` 0)) EQUALS 10_000_000

-- Dental, sum insured 5,000,000. Items: examination 300,000; two scalings of 400,000 (one a year:
-- 400,000); an ordinary filling 500,000; a gold filling 2,000,000 (not listed); dentures 5,000,000
-- (excluded); root canal 1,500,000; emergency care 20 hours after an accident 1,000,000 (capped at
-- 10% of 5,000,000 = 500,000); emergency care 30 hours after 800,000 (not within 24 hours).
-- 300,000 + 400,000 + 500,000 + 1,500,000 + 500,000 = 3,200,000.
`the dental items` MEANS
    LIST `examination, X-ray and diagnosis` `costing` 300_000
       , `scaling` `costing` 400_000
       , `scaling` `costing` 400_000
       , `a filling with an ordinary material` `costing` 500_000
       , `a filling with another material` `costing` 2_000_000
       , `making dentures` `costing` 5_000_000
       , `root canal treatment` `costing` 1_500_000
       , (`emergency treatment after an accident` 20) `costing` 1_000_000
       , (`emergency treatment after an accident` 30) `costing` 800_000
#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` (`a dental claim under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, for` `the dental items` `, scalings already paid` 0) EQUALS 3_200_000
-- One scaling already paid this year: the 400,000 drops out.
#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` (`a dental claim under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, for` `the dental items` `, scalings already paid` 1) EQUALS 2_800_000
-- Emergency care at exactly 24 hours counts.
#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` (`a dental claim under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, for` (LIST (`emergency treatment after an accident` 24) `costing` 400_000) `, scalings already paid` 0) EQUALS 400_000

-- Maternity, limit 20,000,000: a complication costing 8,000,000 is paid; 25,000,000 is capped.
#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` (`a maternity claim by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, for` (`a complication` `postpartum haemorrhage`) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, costs` (`costs of` 8_000_000 `, another insurer paid` 0 `, paid this year` 0)) EQUALS 8_000_000
#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` (`a maternity claim by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, for` (`a complication` `postpartum haemorrhage`) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, costs` (`costs of` 25_000_000 `, another insurer paid` 0 `, paid this year` 0)) EQUALS 20_000_000

-- Death from illness: the sum insured for B.4, 50,000,000.
#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` (`a death or injury claim for` `death from illness` `, cause` `an illness` `, under` `the renewed certificate` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, with` `a death by accident on 1 June 2026`) EQUALS 50_000_000

§§ `The assessment: grounds of refusal`

-- The base claim of the Part IV tests is covered and pays 9,000,000.
#ASSERT `the claim is covered` (`the base claim with conditions` EMPTY `and circumstances` EMPTY)
#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` (`the base claim with conditions` EMPTY `and circumstances` EMPTY) EQUALS 9_000_000
-- An excluded claim pays nothing, and says why.
#ASSERT `the grounds of refusal of` (`the base claim with conditions` (LIST `tuberculosis`) `and circumstances` EMPTY) EQUALS LIST (`excluded by Part IV item` 14)
#ASSERT `the amount PVI pays on` (`the base claim with conditions` (LIST `tuberculosis`) `and circumstances` EMPTY) EQUALS 0
-- Premium unpaid; benefit not taken; event before the term; waiting period.
#ASSERT `the grounds of refusal of` (`a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the renewed certificate, premium unpaid` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a three-night stay` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` `no other costs`) EQUALS LIST `the premium was not paid in full and on time`
#ASSERT `the grounds of refusal of` (`a claim for` `death from illness` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the renewed certificate with no rider` `, on` (YMD 2026 6 1) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a three-night stay` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` `no other costs`) EQUALS LIST `the benefit is not on the certificate`, (`outside the scope of the benefit` "B.4.1: death from an illness")
#ASSERT `the grounds of refusal of` (`a claim for` `inpatient treatment` `, cause` `an illness` `, by` `the adult woman` `, under` `the first-year certificate` `, on` (YMD 2025 12 20) `, at` `a public hospital in Hanoi` `, treated` `a three-night stay` `, for` EMPTY `, costs` `no other costs`) EQUALS LIST `the event did not arise in the insurance term`, `the event arose in the waiting period`
#ASSERT `the grounds of refusal of` `an illness on 30 January 2026, first year` EQUALS LIST `the event arose in the waiting period`
